[00:16.16]1. A multitude is gathering
[00:21.54]from ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:25.74]Collected by the Christ and his
[00:30.38]anointed congregation.
[00:33.84]God’s Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[00:38.16]We pray his will be done on earth.
[00:42.44]This hope is a gift of priceless worth,
[00:47.20]Giving joy and consolation.
[00:51.62](Chorus)
[00:52.38]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[00:56.34]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[01:00.98]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[01:04.18]And praise him with one accord.
[01:14.94]2. We praise the Christ, our reigning King,
[01:19.34]with sounds of jubilation.
[01:23.60]This Prince of Peace will be our Judge
[01:27.72]and bring about salvation.
[01:31.76]We see the joys that lie ahead:
[01:36.04]An earth released from fear and dread;
[01:40.18]The time for our Lord to raise the dead.
[01:44.74]What a time for exultation!
[01:49.24](Chorus)
[01:50.22]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[01:54.22]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[01:58.10]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[02:01.98]And praise him with one accord.
